[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5344.39, "timestamp": "01:29:04", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5346.07, "timestamp": "01:29:06", "text": "本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5348.709, "timestamp": "01:29:08", "text": "ホラーゲームを配信したいんですか？ 初めての注文なら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5353.03, "timestamp": "01:29:13", "text": "スーリヤクンさん、本当に対応できる自信がありますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5355.99, "timestamp": "01:29:15", "text": "もし耐えられないと感じたら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5359.189, "timestamp": "01:29:19", "text": "昨日私がホラー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5362.149, "timestamp": "01:29:22", "text": "ゲームを配信した時にあなたがくれたアドバイスのように、私は泣いて叫びました。 えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.189, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "昨日、昨日私がそれを行ったんでしたっけ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5367.03, "timestamp": "01:29:27", "text": "土曜日ですよね？ ええ、昨日そうしました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5369.59, "timestamp": "01:29:29", "text": "。 そうそう。   ええ、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5377.214, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I am not quite sureUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/UW5IY-ibBqa8jgTymoCIBQUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/UW5IY-ibBqa8jgTymoCIBQ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5382.709, "timestamp": "01:29:42", "text": "。 よくわからないけど、やってみて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5384.55, "timestamp": "01:29:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5386.07, "timestamp": "01:29:46", "text": "ええと、やってみて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5389.27, "timestamp": "01:29:49", "text": "できるかどうか試してみてください。 そうでなくても構いません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.03, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.11, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "さらに、ジムは燃え尽き症候群を解消するのに非常に効果的です"}]